	(gr_text "KOGUMA MK4 main board for tire 24mm (t24): outline t24v2 (mechanical/pcb/pcb_outline_t24v2.dxf), 0.6mm. Fixed by mechanics: J5/J6 encoder pads, D70-D77 wall sensor holders (bottom), D90-D96 UI LEDs (order tentative), H1-H4 M2 posts. Others: not placed yet"
